  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory-style headlights are identical to the original unit in every way— the same quality and same method of installation. And every headlight assembly undergoes strict testing before it leaves the factory. All wiring is rigorously tested to ensure the light is completely functional, and the housing is sealed with high-quality silicone to prevent any trapped moisture.\nFitment\n2011-2019 Dodge Grand Caravan\n2008-2016 Chrysler Town & Country\n(Don't compatible with Factory Xenon HID Projector headlight models; Only compatible with Factory Halogen headlight models.)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle compatibility: headlights assembly compatible with 2011-2019 Dodge Grand Caravan / 2008-2016 Chrysler Town & Country (not compatible with Factory Xenon HID Projector headlight models); high beam/low beam bulb type: H11; bulbs are not included\nWaterproof: fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nBrighter lighting: the metallic parabolic reflectors provide more light output to create a broader and smoother beam\nSafety reflector: the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact resistance: the polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road; professional installation would be highly recommended",
